# Local Development & SSH Walkthrough

## 1. Local Development (Flask)
- **Host**: `localhost:5007`
- **Database**: Local Postgres container (`flask-db`) is integrated.
- **Verification**: Containers are up and running healthily.

## 2. Remote Access (DeanOS)

### Environment Clarification
- Run `nmcli` and `nmtui` only on the **DeanOS terminal** (via SSH or physical access).
- Use `sudo` for system-level changes if you get "Permission denied".

### Passwordless Sudo
To stop the password prompt:
```bash
echo "$USER ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:ALL" | sudo tee /etc/sudoers.d/90-passwordless-sudo
```

### SSH Configuration (Windows)
File: [C:\Users\Deacjx\.ssh\config](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.ssh/config)
```text
Host DeanOS
    HostName 192.168.1.163
    User dean
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/zimaos_key
```

### Manual Key Installation (DeanOS)
If you get permission errors, use `sudo` and ensure you are in the correct home directory:
```bash
sudo mkdir -p ~/.ssh
sudo touch ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
echo "ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHTfMWfVHu0gHrY7dB3OdNVbum//AofdGCh9ur/bgSru7 deancjx@Workstation" | sudo tee -a ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
sudo chmod 700 ~/.ssh
sudo chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
sudo chown -R $USER:$USER ~/.ssh
```
